# What mullvad.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# knows this tool exists. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
# Optional, because the spoon already answers an absent backend with a row that explains
# itself, so the picker still opens and says what is wrong.
mullvad | path | mullvad | optional | the relay CLI behind every VPN control and location
